// PVS-Studio diagnostic configuration for CI (pvs-studio-dotnet -C).
// Exclude generated and build artifacts from analysis.
//V_EXCLUDE_PATH **/bin/**
//V_EXCLUDE_PATH **/obj/**
//V_EXCLUDE_PATH **/*.g.cs
//V_EXCLUDE_PATH **/*.AssemblyInfo.cs
//V_EXCLUDE_PATH **/AssemblyInfo.cs
//
// CI quality gate fails on GA levels 1 and 2 only (see .github/workflows/ci.yml).
// Level 3 findings (e.g. V3163 empty best-effort catch) remain visible in the HTML/JSON artifact.
